  "coefficientDefinition": "coefficient = value / median_across_metros(index). For BEA: RPP / 93.537. Salary: salary_B = salary_A * coef_B / coef_A. Prefer BEA for purchasing-power salary scaling; ACS/HUD are housing-only; averages are exploratory.",
  "salaryScaling": {
    "formula": "salary_B = salary_A * coef_B / coef_A",
    "recommendedIndex": "bea",
    "baselineExample": {
      "place": "Huntsville, AL metro (CBSA 26620)",
      "coef_bea": 0.995,
      "rpp": 93.072
    }
  },
  "caveats": [
    "County RPPs are experimental (OUSEA), ~2021 vintage — not official BEA.",
    "Place values are rent-scaled proxies, not official prices.",
    "Averages (simple/weighted) are exploratory; do not substitute for BEA when scaling salaries.",
    "Spatial coefficients are cross-sectional (median metro = 1.00 at survey year), NOT time-indexed to Jan 1995.",
    "Year mix: metro BEA 2024; county ~2021; place rents ACS 2019–2023; HUD FY2025.",
    "Puerto Rico is not in BEA/OUSEA RPP coverage.",
    "Never mix place/county baseline with metro destination coefficients."
  ],
